│ (search)\n**Affected endpoint:** `GET /cgi-bin/badstore.cgi?action=search&searchquery=...`\n\n**Description:**\nSearch input is incorporated into an SQL query       │
│ without proper handling. Submitting a single quote triggers a server error and the application discloses the backend SQL query in the response body.\n\n**Evidence / │
│ Steps to reproduce:**\n1. Request a normal search:\n   - `curl -sS 'http://badstore/cgi-bin/badstore.cgi?action=search&searchquery=test' | head`\n2. Trigger the     │
